Whatever.

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:09.986
Sorry about that.
That's my cousin, Petey.

00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:12.614
He agreed to let me stay here
with him in LA

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:15.158
while I conduct
my investigation.

00:01:15.658 --> 00:01:18.411
As long as I let him help me out
from time to time.

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:20.538
But... okay, here we go.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:21.998
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

