00:24:40.061 --> 00:24:42.189
leave Red Lobster before LaToya.

00:24:42.564 --> 00:24:45.483
Gabe's audition for
 Sons of Anarchy: The Musical

00:24:45.734 --> 00:24:46.610
checks out.

00:24:46.943 --> 00:24:49.487
Tasha's tags are
definitely expired.

00:24:49.821 --> 00:24:51.907
And there's nothing
pointing in her direction

00:24:51.990 --> 00:24:53.033
as a suspect.

00:24:54.201 --> 00:24:58.163
I did however follow up
on Rufus's podcast alibi,

00:24:58.663 --> 00:25:00.498
and he was telling the truth,

00:25:01.082 --> 00:25:03.710
except about one little thing.

00:25:05.462 --> 00:25:08.006
There were only 14 views
on that podcast,

00:25:08.256 --> 00:25:10.550
not nearly 19 or 20.

00:25:11.426 --> 00:25:13.637
But unfortunately
a sorry podcast

00:25:14.429 --> 00:25:16.139
doesn't make you a murderer.

00:25:16.514 --> 00:25:20.894
(DOOR SLOWLY CREAKING OPEN)

00:25:21.436 --> 00:25:23.355
PETEY: Psst, Rose!
You recording?

00:25:23.438 --> 00:25:24.940
ROSE: Yes, Petey, what?

00:25:25.607 --> 00:25:27.984
PETEY: My spork set is missing.
You seen it?

00:25:28.068 --> 00:25:30.153
ROSE: (SIGHS) No, I haven't,
I haven't seen it.

00:25:30.237 --> 00:25:31.446
LaToya's still missing too!

00:25:31.780 --> 00:25:33.281
PETEY: Still? Damn.

00:25:33.531 --> 00:25:35.408
(DOOR CREAKS CLOSED)

00:25:35.617 --> 00:25:38.745
ROSE: It was time I tried
my luck with a higher authority:

00:25:39.246 --> 00:25:41.122
the inner city
police department.

00:25:41.581 --> 00:25:43.416
I met with the lead detective
on the case,

00:25:43.792 --> 00:25:45.335
to try and get some answers.

00:25:46.962 --> 00:25:49.089
-(PHONE RINGING)
-POLICE OFFICER:
 I don't know what to tell ya.

00:25:49.631 --> 00:25:51.341
We have put
as many resources

00:25:51.424 --> 00:25:53.677
as we can towards
finding Toyota.

00:25:55.136 --> 00:25:57.639
We put her photo up,
all around the city.

00:25:58.807 --> 00:26:00.850
We've held several press
conferences.

00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:05.313
ROSE: I went out and attended
one of these press conferences.

00:26:06.189 --> 00:26:08.817
OFFICER: I wanna assure
the good people of Los Angeles

00:26:08.900 --> 00:26:12.487
that we are doing everything
in our power to ensure

00:26:12.570 --> 00:26:14.322
the safe return of this lost

00:26:14.572 --> 00:26:15.407
Toyota.

00:26:15.490 --> 00:26:17.284
REPORTER: Sir, again,
this is the case

00:26:17.367 --> 00:26:18.743
about the missing
African American girl,

00:26:18.827 --> 00:26:20.996
LaToya Thompson,
not a missing vehicle.

00:26:21.079 --> 00:26:22.747
OFFICER:
No further comment at this time.

00:26:22.831 --> 00:26:26.835
(REPORTERS CHATTERING)

00:26:27.794 --> 00:26:29.838
ROSE: I wanted to catch up
with this reporter

00:26:30.171 --> 00:26:33.383
as she seemed to be
just as dedicated to this case

00:26:33.466 --> 00:26:34.259
as I was.

00:26:34.718 --> 00:26:38.054
Unfortunately, by the time
the press conference ended,

00:26:38.722 --> 00:26:41.474
she too had been reported
missing.

00:26:42.934 --> 00:26:44.019
(SIGHS)

00:26:44.686 --> 00:26:45.979
I can't find everyone.

00:26:46.313 --> 00:26:50.734
I just can't. I-- I-- I'm tired.
I can't.

00:26:52.902 --> 00:26:57.657
(CLOCK TICKING)

00:27:00.368 --> 00:27:04.706
After running out of ideas,
I knew there was one last place

00:27:04.789 --> 00:27:05.707
I could turn.

00:27:06.207 --> 00:27:09.294
A place that was sure to have
a black woman's best interest

00:27:09.377 --> 00:27:10.211
at heart.

00:27:10.712 --> 00:27:13.798
I decided to go to a local
Inglewood hair salon

00:27:13.882 --> 00:27:15.216
where LaToya frequented.

00:27:16.051 --> 00:27:17.093
And honestly,

00:27:17.886 --> 00:27:19.012
I needed a trim.

00:27:19.721 --> 00:27:23.433
To no surprise, the girl
who cuts hair wasn't available,

00:27:23.808 --> 00:27:26.269
because she too
had gone missing.

00:27:27.562 --> 00:27:29.272
Very inconvenient for me.

00:27:30.065 --> 00:27:30.940
But...

00:27:32.233 --> 00:27:35.487
anyway, I got the salon
up to speed on the case,

00:27:35.779 --> 00:27:38.073
I gave them a rundown
of all the evidence

00:27:38.156 --> 00:27:40.075
and interviews I've collected
so far.

00:27:41.493 --> 00:27:42.494
(SHOP BELL DINGS)

00:27:42.952 --> 00:27:44.245
STYLIST:
 Y'all know who did it right?

00:27:44.788 --> 00:27:45.955
That white man!

00:27:46.414 --> 00:27:49.834
You know they crazy. Just like
all them Lifetime movies.

00:27:49.918 --> 00:27:51.628
ROSE: But his story checks out.

00:27:51.836 --> 00:27:53.505
I called the college
about his audition.

00:27:53.838 --> 00:27:56.091
STYLIST: Did the person
who answered the phone
sound white?

00:27:56.424 --> 00:27:58.676
ROSE: Maybe. I'm-- I'm not sure.

00:27:59.177 --> 00:28:04.140
STYLIST: Mmm. There it is,
you can't trust a white man!

00:28:04.224 --> 00:28:06.101
Even if his story check out.

00:28:06.601 --> 00:28:09.062
You know they all work together.

00:28:09.687 --> 00:28:11.064
That girl is dead.

00:28:11.272 --> 00:28:13.108
STYLIST 2:
No, no, no, it was Rufus.

00:28:13.566 --> 00:28:16.820
You sound like just the rest
of these bum-ass LA dudes.

00:28:16.903 --> 00:28:18.822
Girl, hire you
a private investigator

00:28:18.905 --> 00:28:21.991
to follow Rufus. I can give you
the number to one now,

00:28:22.075 --> 00:28:24.285
he been following both
my niggas for a week.

00:28:24.536 --> 00:28:27.122
ROSE: I don't think that
will be necessary.

00:28:27.455 --> 00:28:29.124
STYLIST 1:
Well, I think she's still alive.

00:28:29.624 --> 00:28:31.835
What you need to do is set up
your own tip line.

00:28:31.918 --> 00:28:33.128
Those police don't care.

00:28:33.628 --> 00:28:36.047
It's our job to find her,
before she winds up

00:28:36.131 --> 00:28:38.716
under the sea,
or on some wig chart

00:28:38.800 --> 00:28:39.926
like the rest of them.

00:28:43.012 --> 00:28:48.143
(CLOCK TICKING)

00:28:50.812 --> 00:28:54.399
ROSE: She was right.
We do have to find her.

00:28:54.983 --> 00:28:58.069
The last thing we need
is LaToya's face plastered

00:28:58.153 --> 00:29:00.947
on a wig chart in a run-down
beauty supply store.

00:29:01.531 --> 00:29:04.826
We can't give up!
I won't let us.

00:29:05.368 --> 00:29:07.745
So I took her advice,
and started

00:29:07.829 --> 00:29:09.372
a tip line of my own.

00:29:10.498 --> 00:29:14.002
I made a Facebook page too,
where all black gossip lives.

00:29:14.752 --> 00:29:19.507
And after just two weeks,
the calls were rolling in.

00:29:20.800 --> 00:29:23.386
ROSE: (VOICEMAIL MESSAGE)
Thank you for calling She Lost,

00:29:23.470 --> 00:29:27.307
where our number-one priority
is bringing LaToya home.

00:29:27.682 --> 00:29:29.601
Please leave your name,
number,

00:29:29.684 --> 00:29:33.271
and any information you may have
after the beep.

00:29:33.354 --> 00:29:34.647
(RECORDING TONE)

00:29:35.398 --> 00:29:41.279
Hello, uh, my name is Crystal
and I think I just saw LaToya

00:29:41.362 --> 00:29:42.989
at the swing stop in Inglewood.

00:29:43.573 --> 00:29:45.575
I'm here waiting for
my garlic wings,

00:29:45.658 --> 00:29:48.703
and this nigga with a dead tooth
tried to talk to me.

00:29:49.329 --> 00:29:52.874
After I gave him my number,
I seen him go to his car

00:29:53.082 --> 00:29:54.876
and there was a girl
in the passenger seat.

00:29:55.126 --> 00:29:56.753
I couldn't tell what she looked
like,

00:29:56.836 --> 00:29:59.255
but I remember him
from your Facebook ads.

00:30:00.089 --> 00:30:04.719
That's all the info I got.
So, do not call me back.

00:30:05.512 --> 00:30:07.055
(RECORDING TONE)

00:30:07.555 --> 00:30:10.266
This is Jessica,
I just seen your flyer

00:30:10.350 --> 00:30:11.476
outside the bowling alley.

00:30:11.726 --> 00:30:15.104
I don't know who LaToya is,
but can you put flyers up of me?

00:30:15.688 --> 00:30:17.732
I want niggas looking
for me too.

00:30:18.066 --> 00:30:19.108
(RECORDING TONE)

00:30:19.317 --> 00:30:22.403
Hey, Rose!
Petey from downstairs,
your cousin.

00:30:22.737 --> 00:30:24.948
No LaToya but I found
my spork set!

00:30:25.198 --> 00:30:27.158
-You wouldn't believe where--
-(RECORDING TONE)

00:30:27.617 --> 00:30:30.411
Yo, this Mike. I think I have
some info that could help you

00:30:30.495 --> 00:30:31.913
find this LaToya chick.

00:30:32.121 --> 00:30:33.414
Is there a reward though?

00:30:33.873 --> 00:30:35.583
If so, call me back.

00:30:37.085 --> 00:30:42.090
(CLOCK TICKING)

00:30:44.676 --> 00:30:47.470
ROSE: After going through these
voicemails,

00:30:48.304 --> 00:30:50.765
I decided to give Mike
a call back.

00:30:51.558 --> 00:30:54.185
After I lied and told him
there was a reward,

00:30:54.769 --> 00:30:58.940
he finally provided me
with some key information.

00:30:59.399 --> 00:31:02.610
(DIALING PHONE NUMBER)

00:31:03.152 --> 00:31:05.488
(PHONE RINGING)

00:31:06.948 --> 00:31:09.242
(PHONE RINGING)

00:31:10.827 --> 00:31:14.706
MIKE: Before I say shit,
 I need that reward, ASAP.

00:31:15.123 --> 00:31:16.499
I'll text you my PayPal info.

00:31:17.083 --> 00:31:20.253
ROSE: No problem, I'll have
my assistant Petey handle it.

00:31:20.795 --> 00:31:22.630
Cool. Okay, so look.

00:31:22.880 --> 00:31:25.466
I was taking my side piece
on a date out in Long Beach,

00:31:25.758 --> 00:31:28.219
it's safe out there so I knew
nobody was gonna see me.

00:31:28.553 --> 00:31:31.139
It was the same night
you said old girl went missing!

00:31:32.056 --> 00:31:34.225
Anyway, we were walking up
past the docks.

00:31:34.309 --> 00:31:36.227
Shorty I was with had never seen
docks before

00:31:36.311 --> 00:31:38.563
so she was all like,
"Ooh, docks!"

00:31:38.771 --> 00:31:40.106
That's when I saw LaTisha.

00:31:40.398 --> 00:31:41.232
ROSE: LaToya.

00:31:41.983 --> 00:31:44.652
MIKE: Whatever.
 But there she was,
all by herself-- (PHONE STATIC)

00:31:45.653 --> 00:31:47.155
ROSE:
Thanks to Mike's alertness,

00:31:47.488 --> 00:31:49.949
and more importantly,
his infidelity,

00:31:50.575 --> 00:31:54.329
he was able to provide
some very helpful tips.

00:31:55.079 --> 00:32:00.460
We're now one step closer
to finding our beloved LaToya.

00:32:01.127 --> 00:32:02.503
Updates coming soon.

00:32:03.546 --> 00:32:05.965
Until then,
thanks for listening.

00:32:06.382 --> 00:32:09.093
I'm Rose Cranberry,
and I'll see you

00:32:09.344 --> 00:32:13.222
on the next installment of
 Looking for LaToya.

00:32:16.351 --> 00:32:19.687
Looking for LaToya
is a Rose Cranberry production.

00:32:19.979 --> 00:32:22.732
Created, hosted, produced

00:32:22.815 --> 00:32:26.861
and edited by me,
Rose Cranberry.

00:32:27.528 --> 00:32:30.823
If you have questions, comments
or any further information,

00:32:31.199 --> 00:32:32.950
please leave me a message.

00:32:33.618 --> 00:32:36.412
I'd like to thank my
Burlington Coat Factory family,

00:32:36.704 --> 00:32:39.248
Red Lobster, the Inglewood
Hair Salon,

00:32:39.540 --> 00:32:42.126
and the family and friends
of LaToya Thompson,

00:32:42.543 --> 00:32:45.254
for their participation
in this investigation.

00:32:46.214 --> 00:32:49.384
Oh, and of course,
my cousin Petey,

00:32:49.926 --> 00:32:53.346
for his um, help
and accommodations.

00:32:54.055 --> 00:32:56.891
But I purposely
did not mention

00:32:56.974 --> 00:32:58.101
the police...

00:32:58.559 --> 00:32:59.894
with their bitch-asses.

00:33:06.734 --> 00:33:09.070
ISSA RAE:
Thank you for listening
to Looking for LaToya.

00:33:09.487 --> 00:33:11.280
We came up with the idea
for this series

00:33:11.364 --> 00:33:14.200
in the Insecure writer's room
as a satirical way to highlight

00:33:14.283 --> 00:33:16.411
the plight of missing
black women.

00:33:16.911 --> 00:33:18.246
But that's not a joke.

00:33:18.538 --> 00:33:22.792
And that's why Radio Tenderfoot
and HBO are proud to support

00:33:22.875 --> 00:33:24.585
the Black and Missing
Foundation.

00:33:25.086 --> 00:33:28.131
The Black and Missing Foundation
is a nonprofit organization

00:33:28.214 --> 00:33:31.134
founded in 2008
by Natalie Wilson

00:33:31.217 --> 00:33:33.761
and Derrica Wilson, to help
bring awareness to

00:33:33.845 --> 00:33:36.222
an invisible group:
our missing.

00:33:36.806 --> 00:33:38.433
Their mission is to
bring awareness

00:33:38.516 --> 00:33:41.018
to the hundreds of thousands
of missing brown and black

00:33:41.102 --> 00:33:44.313
men, women and children,
to search for those missing,

00:33:44.564 --> 00:33:47.483
and to educate our community
on personal safety.

00:33:47.942 --> 00:33:50.695
Since its inception,
the Black and Missing Foundation

00:33:50.778 --> 00:33:53.614
has supported and provided
access to resources

00:33:53.698 --> 00:33:54.907
for thousands of families

00:33:55.116 --> 00:33:56.451
searching for
missing loved ones.

00:33:56.993 --> 00:34:00.663
Their efforts have helped locate
more than 300 missing persons.

00:34:00.997 --> 00:34:04.375
But with your support,
so many more can return home.

00:34:04.792 --> 00:34:07.211
Let's all, the media,
law enforcement,

00:34:07.295 --> 00:34:11.007
and the community, do our part
to help us find us.

00:34:11.799 --> 00:34:14.552
Visit bamfi.org

00:34:14.886 --> 00:34:18.097
to join the movement to
#helpusfindus.

00:34:18.765 --> 00:34:21.893
It only takes one person
to come forward with information

00:34:21.976 --> 00:34:23.519
to help solve the case.

